1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
The model doesn't run your tools. Your code does.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:10,600
The user asks. The model proposes a tool and arguments. Your code decides whether to run it. The result goes back to the model, which writes the answer. Permissions live in your code, not in the prompt.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:20,200
Before you ship, ask: which tools, with what scope? Which actions need approval? What happens when a call fails? Is every call logged?

4
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:25,200
The model suggests. Your code acts. Save this for your next agent review.
